      "description": "Watch Kairat Almaty vs Omonia Nicosia highlights and goals from UEFA Champions League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on July 29, 2026. The tension was palpable in Almaty as two determined sides faced off in a high-stakes continental encounter. Fans witnessed a battle of nerves where discipline and endurance were tested to the absolute limit. Red Cards and Early Breakthroughs On July 29, 2026 , Kairat Almaty hosted Omonia Nicosia in a crucial UEFA Champions League fixture. The match took a dramatic turn early in the first half when Andronikos Kakoullis was shown a straight red card in the 26th minute, leaving Omonia to play with ten men amid heavy protests. Kairat looked to capitalize immediately, making tactical substitutions that paid dividends in the 37th minute. Luis Mata provided a perfectly weighted assist for Edmilson Filho , who found the back of the net to give the hosts the advantage. Resilience and Extra Time Drama Despite the numerical disadvantage, the Cypriot side displayed incredible grit, pushing the game into extra time as the intensity flared with yellow cards for Oiva Jukkola , Mateo Maric , and Senou Coulibaly . The challenge for Omonia became even more monumental in the 111th minute when Senou Coulibaly received his second yellow card and was sent off. Down to nine men, the visitors managed to hold on through the final minutes of extra time to force a shootout. Clinical Finish in the Shootout With no further goals after 120 minutes, the match proceeded to a penalty shootout. It was a rollercoaster of emotions as Jure Balkovec and Nikolas Panayiotou missed their attempts for Omonia , while Olzhas Baybek failed to convert for Kairat . However, successful strikes from players like Aleksandr Martynovich and Anastasios Chatzigiovanis kept the pressure high. Ultimately, Mansur Birkurmanov stepped up to convert the decisive penalty, securing a hard-fought victory for the Kazakh side on a dramatic night."
